  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-00000000001b', 'SEC Company Registration', 'SEC (Securities and Exchange Commission)', 'This makes your business a legal company, separate from its owners. It is for partnerships, corporations, and one person corporations.', 'Go to the SEC eSPARC website.
Check that your company name is free to use.
Fill in your company details, capital, and officers.
Download the forms, sign them, and upload them.
Pay the fee online.
Download your certificate.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000002', 'Barangay Business Clearance', 'Barangay hall of your business address', 'This shows your barangay has no objection to your business. Your city needs it before giving you a permit. Confirm the exact list at your barangay hall.', 'Prepare copies of your DTI or SEC papers, lease contract, and insurance.
Go to your barangay hall and submit them.
Pay the fees at the cashier.
Get your clearance and business plate.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000003', 'Certificate of Conformance', 'Pasig City CPDO (City Planning and Development Office), Zoning Division', 'This shows your business place follows the city''s zoning rules.', 'Open the Pasig CLIMA website and make an application.
Upload your documents.
Wait 3 to 7 working days.
Download your certificate.', 'If your business is inside a mall or in the Ortigas Center, ask CPDO if you still need this.'),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000004', 'Fire Safety Inspection Certificate for Occupancy', 'BFP (Bureau of Fire Protection), Pasig City', 'This shows your building is safe from fire before people use it.', 'Open the BFP Fire Safety Inspection System website and make an account.
Upload your documents and get your payment order.
Pay the fee online.
Get ready for the fire inspector''s visit.
Get your certificate. It can take 3 to 7 working days.', 'Only if your place is newly built or renovated.'),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000005', 'Business Application Form and Documents', 'BPLD (Business Permits and Licensing Department), Pasig City Hall', 'This is where you officially apply for your business permit.', 'Download the Unified Business Application Form, or get a copy at the BPLD office.
Fill it in.
Bring all your documents, originals and clear photocopies.
Submit them at the BPLD counter.
Wait while they check your papers. This takes about 5 to 10 minutes.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000006', 'Tax Order of Payment', 'BPLD (Business Permits and Licensing Department), Pasig City Hall', 'This is a paper that shows how much tax and fees you must pay.', 'Wait while BPLD computes your taxes and fees.
Get your printed Tax Order of Payment at the releasing counter. This takes about 20 to 30 minutes.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000007', 'Pay Local Business Taxes and Fees', 'City Treasurer''s Office, Cashier', 'You pay your city taxes and fees here. You get an Official Receipt as proof.', 'Read the list of taxes and fees on your Tax Order of Payment.
Go to the Cashier of the City Treasurer''s Office.
Pay the total.
Keep your Official Receipt.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000008', 'Health, Environment, and Fire Permits', 'Pasig BOSS (Business One-Stop Shop), with City Health Department, CENRO (City Environment and Natural Resources Office), and BFP (Bureau of Fire Protection)', 'Some permits depend on your kind of business, like health and fire safety. You get them here.', 'Go to the Pasig BOSS counters.
Show your paid receipt and Tax Order of Payment.
Submit papers for each office you need.
Get checked or inspected if the office asks.
Get your permits.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-000000000009', 'Claim Business Permit and Sticker', 'Pasig BOSS (Business One-Stop Shop), at the BPLD office in Pasig City Hall', 'This is where you get your official business permit.', 'Go to the BPLD office at Pasig City Hall.
Show your documents to the releasing officer.
Sign and claim your permit and sticker.
Put your permit where customers can see it.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-00000000010a', 'BIR Business Registration for Sole Proprietors', 'BIR (Bureau of Internal Revenue)', 'This registers your business with the tax office so you can pay your taxes the right way. You get a BIR Certificate of Registration. It is for sole proprietors. You can also do this in person at your Revenue District Office (RDO).', 'Go to the BIR ORUS (Online Registration and Update System) website and make an account.
Fill in BIR Form 1901 online and upload your documents.
Wait for an email about your application. This takes 1 to 3 days.
If you are approved, pay the ₱30 documentary stamp tax online.
Find your Certificate of Registration in your ORUS account.', NULL),
  ('44444444-4444-4444-4444-00000000010b', 'BIR Business Registration for Corporations and Partnerships', 'BIR (Bureau of Internal Revenue)', 'This registers your company with the tax office so you can pay your taxes the right way. You get a BIR Certificate of Registration. It is for partnerships, corporations, and one person corporations. You can also do this in person at your Revenue District Office (RDO).', 'Go to the BIR ORUS (Online Registration and Update System) website and make an account.
Fill in BIR Form 1903 online and upload your documents.
Wait for an email about your application. This takes 1 to 3 days.
If you are approved, pay the ₱30 documentary stamp tax online.
Find your Certificate of Registration in your ORUS account.', NULL);


